    enonce: "نعتبر <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a = 3 - 2√2</span> و <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">b = 6 + 4√2</span>، و قد رأينا أنّ <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a × b = 2</span> أحسب<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">: G = a<sup>3</sup> b<sup>4</sup> = (3 - 2√2)<sup>3</sup> × (6 + 4√2)<sup>4</sup></span>",
